data |> 
  sample_groups(5) |> #select 5 groups (participants)
  aggregate_Datetime("15 mins", type = "floor") |> #condense data to 15-minute intervals
  gg_days() |>  #create timeline plot
  gg_photoperiod(melidos_coordinates[[site]]) #add photoperiod information
```

::: {.cell-output-display}
